CHIP RANGES MACH111
PIN ? A[2..0]
PIN ? Y[0..8]
EQUATIONS
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 2..3: BEGIN Y[0]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 3..2: BEGIN Y[1]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 0..7: BEGIN Y[2]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 1..6: BEGIN Y[3]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 0..6: BEGIN Y[4]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 1..7: BEGIN Y[5]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 2..6: BEGIN Y[6]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 4..7: BEGIN Y[7]=1 END END
CASE(A[2..0]) BEGIN 7..4: BEGIN Y[8]=1 END END
